    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neither rain, nor snow, nor galactic apocalypse can keep the Pan Galactic Postal Service from their appointed rounds! Join a 4-player co-op team of sci-fi letter carriers to deliver parcels to a variety of unappreciative recipients across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/6c4519a7306239994124a646927152ac.poster.avif?t=1749166149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/6c4519a7306239994124a646927152ac.webm?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/6c4519a7306239994124a646927152ac.mp4?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Essential Workers Only</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful! Interdimensional rifts have unleashed otherworldly alien horrors across the Hegemon, and only essential workers are allowed on the streets. That means YOU!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/1ab881e4274ea4013ba13854049013fb.poster.avif?t=1749166149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/1ab881e4274ea4013ba13854049013fb.webm?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/1ab881e4274ea4013ba13854049013fb.mp4?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Up with Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to four friends in online multiplayer co-op. Seek out delivery destinations, pick up outgoing mail, and blast through waves of rapacious alien monsters as you meet your delivery quotas and earn money that you can use to buy new items and weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/373e365b0f47b57896e0016d4648002e.poster.avif?t=1749166149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/373e365b0f47b57896e0016d4648002e.webm?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/373e365b0f47b57896e0016d4648002e.mp4?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Happens in Mailstrom...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of ammo? Feel free to open any parcel and use whatever you find to defend yourself! Sure, it's illegal - but we won't tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/785a76e8580ad79ebb4d40f014275925.poster.avif?t=1749166149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/785a76e8580ad79ebb4d40f014275925.webm?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/785a76e8580ad79ebb4d40f014275925.mp4?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mailstrom allows up to 4 players to team up in a fast-paced FPS where finding delivery addresses is as big a challenge as staying alive! Help one another as much as you can by carrying different items that can be used to defeat enemies, increase deliveries, and figure out where the heck you're supposed to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to three friends in chaotic online co-op, or brave the apocalypse solo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience endless variety with procedurally randomized streets, obstacles, and delivery locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate loadouts with teammates\u2014carry different items to maximize survival and efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through increasingly challenging delivery routes with escalating pay and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your postal arsenal with earnings from successful deliveries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Remember:</strong> The best way to improve your pay is to improve your performance, NOT to join a costly and unhelpful union!\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neither rain, nor snow, nor galactic apocalypse can keep the Pan Galactic Postal Service from their appointed rounds! Join a 4-player co-op team of sci-fi letter carriers to deliver parcels to a variety of unappreciative recipients across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/6c4519a7306239994124a646927152ac.poster.avif?t=1749166149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/6c4519a7306239994124a646927152ac.webm?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/6c4519a7306239994124a646927152ac.mp4?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Essential Workers Only</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful! Interdimensional rifts have unleashed otherworldly alien horrors across the Hegemon, and only essential workers are allowed on the streets. That means YOU!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/1ab881e4274ea4013ba13854049013fb.poster.avif?t=1749166149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/1ab881e4274ea4013ba13854049013fb.webm?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/1ab881e4274ea4013ba13854049013fb.mp4?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Up with Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to four friends in online multiplayer co-op. Seek out delivery destinations, pick up outgoing mail, and blast through waves of rapacious alien monsters as you meet your delivery quotas and earn money that you can use to buy new items and weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/373e365b0f47b57896e0016d4648002e.poster.avif?t=1749166149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/373e365b0f47b57896e0016d4648002e.webm?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/373e365b0f47b57896e0016d4648002e.mp4?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Happens in Mailstrom...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of ammo? Feel free to open any parcel and use whatever you find to defend yourself! Sure, it's illegal - but we won't tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/785a76e8580ad79ebb4d40f014275925.poster.avif?t=1749166149\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/785a76e8580ad79ebb4d40f014275925.webm?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458050/extras/785a76e8580ad79ebb4d40f014275925.mp4?t=1749166149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mailstrom allows up to 4 players to team up in a fast-paced FPS where finding delivery addresses is as big a challenge as staying alive! Help one another as much as you can by carrying different items that can be used to defeat enemies, increase deliveries, and figure out where the heck you're supposed to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to three friends in chaotic online co-op, or brave the apocalypse solo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience endless variety with procedurally randomized streets, obstacles, and delivery locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate loadouts with teammates\u2014carry different items to maximize survival and efficiency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through increasingly challenging delivery routes with escalating pay and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your postal arsenal with earnings from successful deliveries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And Remember:</strong> The best way to improve your pay is to improve your performance, NOT to join a costly and unhelpful union!\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Join a co-op team of 4 friends in a first person shooter that sends Pan Galactic Postal Service letter carriers into the locked-down streets of the future! Fight mutated alien horrors as you and your fellow essential workers deliver baubles to hard-to-find destinations! Hey, at least it's a job!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
